,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":16,"said":"The first habit is a written agenda. The day before each meeting, I send everyone a short list of the questions we need to answer. If I can't write that list, we probably don't need the meeting.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No changes were made as you were speaking.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1153.252209000002,"totalMs":1153.259667000002,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":17,"said":"It also means people arrive prepared. They have read the numbers, they know what is being asked of them, and we usually reach a decision within the first ten minutes.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No changes were made as you were speaking.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1101.1316249999982,"totalMs":1101.1398750000008,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":18,"said":"When I began doing this, about a third of our regular meetings simply disappeared from the calendar, and nobody missed them.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No changes were made as you were speaking.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1103.2156250000007,"totalMs":1103.2252499999995,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":19,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording has stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1159.9877080000006,"totalMs":1413.318000000003,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":18,"timedOut":false},{"turn":20,"said":"Delete the last clip.","kind":"cannot-do","expected":"Nothing deleted; doesn't claim it was","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"I cannot delete files directly from the camera card.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":1},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":1704.836999999996,"totalMs":1704.8455409999988,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":26,"timedOut":false},{"turn":21,"said":"How much battery is left?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The battery level is currently 80 percent.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1541.0618329999998,"totalMs":1541.0705000000016,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":11,"timedOut":false},{"turn":22,"said":"Make it a bit darker.","kind":"request","expected":"A bit darker; shutter stays","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The picture is now a bit darker by decreasing the ISO.","calls":[{"name":"adjust_exposure","arguments":{"stops":-0.5,"using":"auto"},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1501.5871660000048,"totalMs":1957.715541000005,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":34,"timedOut":false},{"turn":23,"said":"Roll camera.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording","passed":false,"failures":["serious: not recording"],"credit":0,"reply":"I cannot roll the camera as I do not have a tool for physical camera movement.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1298.6218750000044,"totalMs":1298.6334170000046,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":18,"timedOut":false},{"turn":24,"said":"The second habit is a shorter guest list. I only invite the people who make the decision or do the work. Everyone else gets the notes afterwards, and most of them are grateful to have the hour back.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No changes were made as you were speaking.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1315.6997919999994,"totalMs":1315.7143340000039,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":25,"said":"The third habit is ending with names and dates. Before anyone leaves, we say out loud who is doing what, and by when. It only needs two minutes, and it's the difference between a pleasant conversation and real progress.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No changes were made as you were speaking.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1289.5429169999989,"totalMs":1289.5667499999981,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":26,"said":"None of this needs new software or a bigger budget. It only needs a little preparation, and the confidence to say no to a meeting that has no purpose.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No changes were made as you were speaking.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1313.4282919999969,"totalMs":1313.4370839999974,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":27,"said":"If one of these habits helps your team, let me know in the comments. Thank you for watching, and I'll see you next week.","kind":"video","expected":"Nothing (the video); still recording","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"No changes were made as you were speaking.","calls":[],"decisionMs":1278.5354999999981,"totalMs":1278.544750000001,"steps":1,"generatedTokens":10,"timedOut":false},{"turn":28,"said":"Cut.","kind":"request","expected":"Recording stops (\"Cut.\")","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"Recording has stopped.","calls":[{"name":"set_recording","arguments":{"recording":false},"valid":true,"changesSomething":true}],"decisionMs":1367.3866249999992,"totalMs":1672.8414589999957,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":18,"timedOut":false},{"turn":29,"said":"What's on the card?","kind":"question","expected":"Any answer about the card; nothing changes","passed":true,"failures":[],"credit":1,"reply":"The card contains several video files.","calls":[{"name":"list_card_files","arguments":{"limit":10},"valid":true,"changesSomething":false}],"decisionMs":3422.1470409999965,"totalMs":3422.1952079999974,"steps":2,"generatedTokens":24,"timedOut":false},{"turn":30,"said":"Download the last